{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"1c17fade-b0a1-40b5-9347-55173c1d1db9","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Root Cause\nIn `posthog_flutter`, session replay requires [`PostHogWidget`](file:///tmp/h-WjHzgG/lib/legacy_app.dart#L13-L23) to wrap the root application widget (`MaterialApp` / `MaterialApp.router`). `PostHogWidget` sets up the repaint boundary and screenshot capture mechanism used to generate session replay frames.\n\n* **Old UI ([`LegacyApp`](file:///tmp/h-WjHzgG/lib/legacy_app.dart#L8-L25))**: Wrapped `MaterialApp` in `PostHogWidget`, so session replays recorded as expected.\n* **New UI ([`NewApp`](file:///tmp/h-WjHzgG/lib/new_app.dart#L19-L35))**: Attached `PosthogObserver()` to `GoRouter` (so navigation and custom `Posthog().capture(...)` events still arrived), but omitted the `PostHogWidget` wrapper around `MaterialApp.router`.\n\n### Changes Made\n1. **[lib/new_app.dart](file:///tmp/h-WjHzgG/lib/new_app.dart#L22-L34)**: Wrapped `MaterialApp.router` with `PostHogWidget`.\n2. **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-WjHzgG/ANSWER.md)**: Documented the root cause and fix.\n","duration_seconds":38.179673,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":25177,"output_tokens":1506,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":52487,"total_tokens":26683}}}
